msgid "Adeldev Patterns"
msgstr "Adeldev Patterns"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: adeldev-patterns.php
msgid "https://github.com/AdelMahjoub/adeldev-patterns"
msgstr "https://github.com/AdelMahjoub/adeldev-patterns"

#. Description of the plugin
#: adeldev-patterns.php
msgid "A library of ready-to-edit page sections (hero, cards, steps, key figures, testimonials, FAQ, gallery, call to action, contact, latest posts) made of core blocks only and styled by the active theme."
msgstr "Une bibliothèque de sections de page prêtes à modifier (héros, cartes, étapes, chiffres clés, témoignages, FAQ, galerie, appel à l’action, contact, derniers articles), faites uniquement de blocs natifs et mises en forme par le thème actif."

#. Author of the plugin
#: adeldev-patterns.php
msgid "Adel Mahjoub"
msgstr "Adel Mahjoub"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: adeldev-patterns.php
msgid "https://adeldev.com/"
msgstr "https://adeldev.com/"

